WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.332
Open Audio Overview to customise the discussion.

00:00:01.332 --> 00:00:04.062
Choose a short Deep Dive and specify what the hosts should explain.

00:00:04.062 --> 00:00:08.822
Open the newly generated audio and start listening to the discussion.

00:00:08.822 --> 00:00:11.494
Pause the discussion and inspect the playback-speed menu.
